<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.000" end="00:00:03.919" style="s2">Hi Guys, My name is Nitesh and you are</p>
<p begin="00:00:01.839" end="00:00:05.600" style="s2">welcome to my YouTube channel.  In this video</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.919" end="00:00:07.600" style="s2">also we will continue our Agentic AI Using</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.600" end="00:00:10.000" style="s2">Landgraph playlist.   For the</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.600" end="00:00:13.040" style="s2">past several videos, we have been building a chatbot</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.000" end="00:00:15.120" style="s2">and in every subsequent video,</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.040" end="00:00:17.760" style="s2">we are adding a new feature to that chatbot.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.120" end="00:00:19.840" style="s2">So by this point we have a</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.760" end="00:00:22.560" style="s2">lot of features in the chatbot.  Our chatbot</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.840" end="00:00:25.119" style="s2">has a GUI, short-term memory</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.560" end="00:00:28.560" style="s2">, database persistence, and streaming</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.119" end="00:00:30.960" style="s2">capabilities.  Now today we are going to add a new feature.</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.560" end="00:00:32.719" style="s2">Ok?  So let me tell you a</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.960" end="00:00:36.719" style="s2">problem with our chatbot.</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.719" end="00:00:38.960" style="s2">Our chatbot is currently connected to Open AI&#39;s LLM on the back end.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.719" end="00:00:41.360" style="s2">And that is why</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.960" end="00:00:44.000" style="s2">you can talk to it.  You</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.360" end="00:00:47.039" style="s2">can talk about anything and</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.000" end="00:00:49.760" style="s2">this chatbot will give you the right response.  But till now</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.039" end="00:00:53.120" style="s2">this chatbot does not have the capability to</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.760" end="00:00:55.199" style="s2">perform any action for you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.120" end="00:00:58.719" style="s2">So in today&#39;s video we are going to do exactly this.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.199" end="00:01:01.359" style="s2">We will have our chatbot</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.719" end="00:01:03.680" style="s2">perform some actions.  Basically what we are</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.359" end="00:01:06.560" style="s2">going to do is</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.680" end="00:01:08.880" style="s2">add some tools to our Chartbot.  Ok?  And</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.560" end="00:01:11.520" style="s2">what will happen because of adding those tools is that</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.880" end="00:01:14.400" style="s2">not only will our chatbot be able to talk to us normally,</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.520" end="00:01:16.960" style="s2">but if we give it any work, then</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.400" end="00:01:18.960" style="s2">our chatbot can also do that work for us.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.960" end="00:01:21.040" style="s2">Ok?  Now honestly there is no</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.960" end="00:01:23.200" style="s2">limit.  You can attach any kind of tool to</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.040" end="00:01:25.520" style="s2">your chatbot.  But since this</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.200" end="00:01:28.400" style="s2">is a beginner friendly tutorial.  So</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.520" end="00:01:30.400" style="s2">here we will add some basic tools.  So</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.400" end="00:01:33.360" style="s2">I&#39;m planning to add three tools.  The</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.400" end="00:01:36.159" style="s2">first tool is where our chatbot will have the</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.360" end="00:01:38.560" style="s2">capability to perform any</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.159" end="00:01:41.040" style="s2">numerical calculation.  Basically,</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.560" end="00:01:43.280" style="s2">we will give our chatbot a calculator tool.  The</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.040" end="00:01:46.240" style="s2">second capability we will provide will be to</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.280" end="00:01:48.960" style="s2">search the internet.  At this point,</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.240" end="00:01:51.040" style="s2">our chatbot does not have the</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.960" end="00:01:52.880" style="s2">capability to go online and search for things.  For</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.040" end="00:01:55.200" style="s2">example, if I ask my chatbot,</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.880" end="00:01:57.200" style="s2">tell me what is the top news in India today</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.200" end="00:02:00.000" style="s2">?  Our chatbot won&#39;t be able to tell us this.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.200" end="00:02:02.880" style="s2">But after adding this tool to the internet</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.000" end="00:02:05.439" style="s2">search tool in our chatbot, we will be able to go and</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.880" end="00:02:07.680" style="s2">search on the internet and get our</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.439" end="00:02:11.360" style="s2">results.  And the third capability that we are</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.680" end="00:02:14.080" style="s2">going to add is the stock tool where you</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.360" end="00:02:16.480" style="s2">can enter the name of any company and that tool will bring</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.080" end="00:02:19.280" style="s2">you the stock price of that company at that moment.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.480" end="00:02:21.680" style="s2">Ok?</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.280" end="00:02:23.760" style="s2">So this is what we are going to achieve in today&#39;s video.</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.680" end="00:02:25.760" style="s2">So I have prepared the demo.  Let</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.760" end="00:02:28.319" style="s2">me show you a demo.  So</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.760" end="00:02:30.319" style="s2">if you talk to the chatbot normally, if you say</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.319" end="00:02:32.720" style="s2">hi then it will function in normal mode.</p>
