<p begin="00:02:40.560" end="00:02:45.280" style="s2">execute this particular task.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.319" end="00:02:52.160" style="s2">For example, if I ask him,</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.280" end="00:02:54.480" style="s2">what happened to the Mumbai Monorail last</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.160" end="00:02:57.760" style="s2">week?  Suppose I asked this question.  Ok</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.480" end="00:02:59.760" style="s2">?  Now if the chatbot does not have this particular information then</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.760" end="00:03:02.800" style="s2">it will immediately go and start</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.760" end="00:03:04.640" style="s2">searching on the internet.  Look, here</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.800" end="00:03:07.200" style="s2">you might have noticed that it came and went very quickly, but it was</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.640" end="00:03:10.480" style="s2">written there that it was using Duck Duck</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.200" end="00:03:12.800" style="s2">Go search tool.  So Duck Duck Go is a search engine</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.480" end="00:03:14.959" style="s2">just like Google and our website,</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.800" end="00:03:17.200" style="s2">our chatbot, is</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.959" end="00:03:19.360" style="s2">using Duck Duck Go behind the scenes to search the internet.</p>
